{"date":"2010-06-16","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/94/55/12283_mSdoj.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/94/55/12283_mSdoj.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/94/55/12283_mSdoj.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/94/55/12283_mSdoj.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/94/55/12283_mSdoj.jpg"},"summary":"        20世纪50年代末期，曾经风靡一时的剧场风云变幻，人们迷恋电视、迷恋摇滚，对于曾经伴随他们长大的各种杂耍则不再关注。他是一个经验丰富的魔术师，舞台上得体从容，现实中却不得不为了可怜的生活费而流转于各个表演场所，上至华贵的音乐厅，下至破落偏僻的小酒馆，不变的是他对魔术的执着。在苏格兰某个乡间逗留时，魔术师结识了一个小女孩，她感叹于那些神奇的魔法，于是偷偷离开故乡，转而追随魔术师的脚步。他们辗转来至爱丁堡，生活变得愈加艰辛，而为了满足女孩对魔法的信任和对繁华世界的向往，魔术师不得不想各种办法去赚钱……","name":"L'illusionniste","name_cn":"魔术师","tags":[{"name":"剧场版","count":138,"total_count":725730},{"name":"法国","count":108,"total_count":3664},{"name":"欧美","count":88,"total_count":86863},{"name":"2010","count":85,"total_count":43604},{"name":"动画电影","count":53,"total_count":43910},{"name":"哑剧","count":40,"total_count":44},{"name":"西维亚·乔迈","count":31,"total_count":74},{"name":"原创","count":26,"total_count":621328},{"name":"忧伤","count":25,"total_count":45},{"name":"平静","count":23,"total_count":286},{"name":"治愈","count":21,"total_count":302310},{"name":"长镜头","count":20,"total_count":24},{"name":"SylvainChomet","count":14,"total_count":22},{"name":"PATHE","count":14,"total_count":15},{"name":"映画","count":12,"total_count":6311},{"name":"致郁","count":4,"total_count":23504},{"name":"欧洲","count":3,"total_count":473},{"name":"2010-2019","count":3,"total_count":2181},{"name":"Chomet","count":3,"total_count":9},{"name":"2010s","count":3,"total_count":5578},{"name":"剧场","count":2,"total_count":1901},{"name":"10","count":2,"total_count":1467},{"name":"鈴木亜矢","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"Sylvain.Chomet","count":2,"total_count":5},{"name":"铃木亚矢","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"法国动画","count":2,"total_count":98},{"name":"电影","count":2,"total_count":13588},{"name":"魔术师","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"台词不多","count":1,"t